Keep the real gobject/gio dependencies and make the tests subdirectory conditional.

The previous revision aliased gobject/gio onto dependency('glib-2.0'),
which only links those modules when glib-2.0.pc itself carries their link
flags.  That holds for the flat glib/2.84.0 package but not for the
component-based glib/2.84.0.1.1 that the GTK4 stack in this repository
requires, so a rebuild against that glib failed with undefined g_type_*/
g_object_* symbols.  Looking the modules up by their own pkg-config names
is correct for both layouts.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Conan/OHOS packaging]
